<title>USA: NBTY Inc buys Britain's Holland &amp; Barrett.</title>
<headline>NBTY Inc buys Britain's Holland &amp; Barrett.</headline>
<dateline>BOHEMIA, N.Y. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>NBTY Inc said Friday it has purchased British vitamin and health food chain store Holland &amp; Barrett for $168 million.</p>
<p>The vitamin and nutritional supplement maker said it is paying for the deal through a long-term debt financing arrangement, handled by Chase Manhattan Bank.</p>
<p>NYTY said in a statement that with revenues generated from Holland &amp; Barrett, it anticipates having annual sales in excess of $400 million and will have a combined retail operating in both the U.S. and the U.K. of more than 510 stores by the end of 1997.</p>
</text>
